Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add pyotp dependency for Kite TOTP auto-login

kite_autologin.py imports pyotp to generate TOTP codes but it was
never added to requirements.txt, so KITE_AUTO_LOGIN=true fails at
the import step every run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TTwCHXT3HSQFTa3kX6yUDc
---
 requirements.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/requirements.txt b/requirements.txt
index 9e2b36b..afbc1ca 100644
--- a/requirements.txt
+++ b/requirements.txt
@@ -17,3 +17,4 @@ psycopg2-binary>=2.9.9      # Railway Postgres
 kiteconnect>=5.0,<6.0       # Zerodha Kite Connect
 httpx>=0.27
 python-dotenv>=1.0.1
+pyotp>=2.9                  # TOTP codes for kite_autologin.py
